WEBVTT

00:00:06.019 --> 00:00:08.460
Hi, today we are going to create a form in
Google Forms.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:09.740
It is very simple.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:10.960
Let's go step by step.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:12.930
Open your browser and look for Gmail.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.090
Enter your email address and password.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.380
If you still don't have it, create it.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.040
It will only take you a minute.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.320
Inside Gmail, look up to the right.

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:25.380
In the little square of 9 points,
look for the purple icon that says Forms.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:26.621
Click there.

00:00:26.645 --> 00:00:30.220
Give it to the big button that says,
in white, to start from scratch.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.690
Up there, write the name of your form.

00:00:33.559 --> 00:00:38.420
Just below, add a brief description so that
the organizations know what it is about.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:41.840
To the right, click the button with the
plus sign to add questions.

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:45.736
If you already have them
written in Word, just copy them

00:00:45.737 --> 00:00:47.817
and paste them directly
in the field of the question.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.580
Questions types.

00:00:50.529 --> 00:00:53.040
Next to each question, choose the format
you need.

00:00:54.559 --> 00:00:56.280
Barra for long or short answers.

00:00:57.329 --> 00:00:59.260
Multiple options to choose only one
answer.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:02.700
Cases so that you can mark several options
at the same time.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:36.520
Before you finish, click on the eye icon
in the upper part.

00:01:36.949 --> 00:01:40.340
This is exactly how you will see the
others and verify that it is correct.

00:01:44.929 --> 00:01:45.960
Close this window.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:47.580
All right?

00:01:47.709 --> 00:01:50.880
Then click on the button, publish,
up to the right.

00:01:51.569 --> 00:01:53.940
Inside the window, go to administration
access.

00:01:54.729 --> 00:01:56.900
Select any person with the link.

00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:58.540
Click on list.

00:01:58.889 --> 00:02:00.169
And then click again to publish.

00:02:01.199 --> 00:02:03.580
Then in the upper right part, it has to
appear published.

00:02:04.299 --> 00:02:05.419
There you can copy the link.

00:02:06.639 --> 00:02:09.177
That link you just copied is
the one you will share through

00:02:09.178 --> 00:02:11.260
the communication channels
that the organization has.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:13.580
email, WhatsApp or social networks.

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.510
So that they can answer the form.

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:19.100
If you need a physical or digital copy,
give it to the three dots.

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:20.620
Up to the right.

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.040
Search, print.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:24.280
You can send it to the printer.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:28.380
Or, if you prefer, save it as a PDF file
on your computer.

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:29.440
And that's it.

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:33.300
You already have your form, created,
published and ready to share.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.360
I hope it will be of great help.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:36.760
Go ahead.